 για περισσότερες επιλογές.</p></div></section><section class="py-20 max-w-[980px] mx-auto px-3 w-full"><div class="text-center mb-16"><h2 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 tracking-tight">Πώς να κατεβάσετε μια λίστα αναπαραγωγής Spotify;</h2><div class="h-1.5 w-16 bg-[#0f853c] dark:bg-[#1db954] mx-auto rounded-md"></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-6 relative"><div class="relative group"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border transition-all h-full flex flex-col bg-white border-black/5 shadow-xl shadow-black/[0.02] hover:border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:bg-transparent dark:border-white/5 dark:shadow-none dark:hover:border-[#1db954]/20"><div class="relative w-full h-49 overflow-hidden"><img alt="Αντιγράψτε τον σύνδεσμο Spotify Playlist" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 33vw" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image/?url=%2Fimages%2Fstep1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="p-6 flex flex-col items-center text-center"><span class="mb-4 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#0f7a35] dark:text-[#1db954] border border-[#0f7a35]/20 dark:border-[#1db954]/20">Step <!-- -->1</span><h3 class="font-bold 